  {
   "id": "minishoot-adventures-191761@major-2024-08-10",
   "gameId": "minishoot-adventures-191761",
   "displayName": "Steam Deck Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-08-10T09:58:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After taking a break to recover from launch, we focused on making the game Verified on Steam Deck, while making it more fluid and fix some major issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We rebuilt all UI components that were poorly readable on SteamDeck. Which makes UI more user friendly and accessible for Steam Deck and PC as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We did a final pass on optimization to remove nasty lag spikes and FPS drops. Gameplay on PC is more fluid than ever in epic fights which is especially crucial on SteamDeck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We changed the Steam API to make sure Achievements would work for MacOs user as well. Sorry about that, you should be able to redeem your Achievements if you have a save file around (if not you can find one in the forums about lost save).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Smaller changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where unique keys were carried over to new games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that caused lag and freeze after reloading the game several times. (Many thanks to xcvdgb and Zookster on discord)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the lowest difficulty chosen on the Save slot so you know which Achievement you are eligible to",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made it easier to skip intro (just press Enter or Escape, or Start on gamepad)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Special thanks to our friend and consultant Maxime who helped us a lot during all this process <3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
